# PQVeil-TEE Tor Configuration
# System-wide transparent proxy, DNS, and control port settings

SocksPort 9050 IsolateSOCKSAuth
TransPort 9040
DNSPort 5353
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
VirtualAddrNetworkIPv4 10.192.0.0/10
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 1

DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
PidFile /run/tor/tor.pid
Log notice syslog
ClientOnly 1
SafeLogging 1

